  "ssml": "<speak version=\"1.0\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis\" xmlns:mstts=\"https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts\" xml:lang=\"en-PH\">\n  <voice name=\"en-PH-RosaNeural\">\n    <mstts:express-as style=\"friendly\">\n      <prosody rate=\"93%\" pitch=\"+1%\">\n        Next up, <break time=\"300ms\"/> let&apos;s check <emphasis level=\"moderate\">Part to Whole</emphasis> and <emphasis level=\"moderate\">Location</emphasis>. <break time=\"550ms\"/> One wooden <emphasis level=\"moderate\">plank</emphasis> is part of a whole island bridge. <break time=\"550ms\"/> And where does the Philippine <emphasis level=\"moderate\">Eagle</emphasis> live? <break time=\"650ms\"/> <break time=\"800ms\"/> High up on Mount <phoneme alphabet=\"ipa\" ph=\"hɑːmiˈɡiːtɑːn\"><emphasis level=\"moderate\">Hamiguitan</emphasis></phoneme>! <break time=\"550ms\"/> That&apos;s a <emphasis level=\"moderate\">Location</emphasis> <phoneme alphabet=\"ipa\" ph=\"əˈnælədʒi\">analogy</phoneme>.\n      </prosody>\n    </mstts:express-as>\n  </voice>\n</speak>",
